    "prompt": "You can choose four positive integers $X$, $Y$, $Z$ and $W$. What is the maximum number of odd numbers you can obtain from the six sums $X+Y$, $X+Z$, $X+W$, $Y+Z$, $Y+W$ and $Z+W$?",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
